From: Abzu <abzu@localhost>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] gui: prepend system theme search paths to GSTheme lookup

Abzu overlay (see ../README.md): themes must resolve from
/System/Library/Themes and /Library/Themes/AbzuAqua.theme before any user
directory, so the caustics-capable AbzuAqua theme is the effective default
even for freshly created accounts.

Upstreaming: tracked per-patch in docs/ROADMAP.md.

---
diff --git a/Source/GSTheme.m b/Source/GSTheme.m
index fed5cf2..69069be 100644
--- a/Source/GSTheme.m
+++ b/Source/GSTheme.m
@@ -3,6 +3,15 @@
   NSString *userDomain;
   NSMutableArray *paths = [NSMutableArray new];
 
+  /* Abzu overlay: system-wide theme locations win over user dirs so the
+   * pinned AbzuAqua theme is applied machine-wide (see README). */
+  [paths addObject: @"/System/Library/Themes"];
+  {
+    NSString *sysLib = NSSearchPathForDirectoriesInDomains(NSLibraryDirectory,
+      NSLocalDomainMask, YES)[0];
+    [paths addObject: [sysLib stringByAppendingPathComponent:
+      @"Themes/AbzuAqua.theme"]];
+  }
   userDomain = NSHomeDirectory();
   [paths addObject: [userDomain stringByAppendingPathComponent:
     GSThemesDirectoryDefaultName]];
